      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name} Attempting to use `ConvertUnityConstraintsToVrChatConstraint` with a Game Object list has it iterate through parents of the provided objects for a VRCAvatarDescriptor to modify animations. It could probably use an extra bool parameter to skip the entire descriptor check & warning popup. \n\nI'll try making a tool with the IConstraints[] variant of the function and get back to you.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
