  "details": "From digging, it appears that `ConvertUnityConstraintsToVrChatConstraints` requires or looks for an avatar descriptor to modify animations of. We could benefit from public function that doesn't touch animators or look at animations and **purely** converts constraint components.\n\n(So we'll have the counterpart to `ConvertUnityConstraintTracksToVrChatConstraintTracks` which only modifies animations)",
